      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Shadow Weaver lost her Apprentice years ago; her own fault, really, she expected results from only half the equation.Â  Truly a shame she had needed to take the child apart to learn of her missing piece.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Garnet would rather burn than disappoint.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
